<PageTitle>Label — Unpoly.Blazor.Shadcn</PageTitle>

<h1 class="doc-h1">Label</h1>
<p class="doc-lede">
    Points at the control it names. Without <code>for</code>, clicking the words does nothing and a
    screen reader announces an unnamed field — which is the same bug twice, and the most common
    one in any form.
</p>

