<h2 class="doc-h2">Label in Field</h2>
<p class="doc-note">
    <code>&lt;FieldLabel&gt;</code> is this with the field's state wired in: it dims with a
    disabled control and turns destructive with an invalid one, because it reads them rather than
    being told. Reach for plain <code>&lt;Label&gt;</code> only outside a Field.
</p>
